WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
We have a lot of people there

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:06,010
They are all my children, you say

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,090
You have a bunch of kids there

4
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:23,220
You must take them all away

5
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:31,020
Even a doctor

6
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,100
You shouldn’t even know Nan Ding Kelin

7
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:38,410
It's really a living person, a human being
